  "body": "## What's new in v2.5.26-dev.1-alpha20\n\n- backup: Qobuz, ratings and the rest of Lyrion come back from a backup\n- backup: every backup is encrypted, with one password the device keeps\n- web admin: no admin password to turn SSH on or change the SSH login\n- sources: never adopt the system's own disk as a USB source\n- system disk: no \"disk full\" notice while trying or installing from the ISO\n- tests: an alpha ranks below the dev it previews, as the OTA code says\n- sources: no local folder in RAM, the tmpfs under /mnt is not a disk\n- system disk: a reserve that fits a 16 GB disk, and no more dead weight on it\n",
